  "editorial": {
    "name": "Embla Carousel",
    "descriptionZh": "轻量轮播库，强调顺滑滑动与手势精度，插件系统可挂 Autoplay、Fade、Wheel Gestures，React/Vue/Svelte/Solid 与 SSR 都有对应入口。",
    "takeawayZh": "按框架装 Embla，再按需挂上 Autoplay 等插件",
    "noteZh": "首屏左边是 Embla Carousel 大标题和一句 A lightweight carousel library with fluid motion and great swipe precision，下面 Examples 与 Get started 两个按钮，右边一个蓝紫色原子轨道 logo。往下三张卡并排：Highly Extensible、Plugin System（Add functionality and customize your carousels as you go）、Server-Side Rendering，页脚是 Npm / GitHub / Sponsor 三个链接。顶栏 Docs 里按 Module、React、Vue、Svelte、Solid、CDN 分别给安装说明，并标着 Version: v9 (latest) 与 v8 (stable)；Plugins 一栏列出 Autoplay、Auto Scroll、Auto Height、Class Names、Fade、Wheel Gestures、SSR。",
